  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Words From You is a heartfelt service dedicated to preserving the art of handwritten letters, allowing individuals to write messages today that will be sent out in the future. Our mission is to bridge the gaps of time, distance, and emotions, ensuring that personal sentiments can be shared even when circumstances might otherwise prevent it.<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>How it Works</b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">They receive a welcome package which contains really nice stationery, a welcome packet, and free return shipping.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">They write their letter and send it back to us for storage.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">We will send their letter to their designate recipient when the time has come.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>We offer two methods</b><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>Check-In Method</b>: Their letter is sent when they stop checking in with our email service. Upon signing up for the check-in method users will receive periodic emails to \"check-in\". It's as simple as clicking a link.&nbsp; If they ever stop checking in, then their letters will be dispatched.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>Future Method</b>: It's as simple as selecting a specific date in the future. Their letter will be sent on this exact date.<o:p></o:p></span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>Unique Selling Point</b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><u>Words From You is the only service of its kind</u> that combines the timeless charm of handwritten letters with the modern need for scheduled or conditional sending. This is the only handwritten timed mailed delivery in the world!<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>Payment Terms</b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">Affiliates will receive a 30% commission on all sales generated through their unique link. Payments will be disbursed every 2-weeks.<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\"><b>Other information</b><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;\">In addition to earning via the link, affiliates will also be provided a unique discount code to offer their audience, incentivizing more to use the service. We are particularly interested in collaborating with bloggers, influencers, and others with a platform that aligns with the sentimental, thoughtful nature of our service. Our team is always available for any support or additional information affiliates might need.<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>",
